    "No direct warfarin oral bioavailability record was retrieved; all retrieved analogues have low Morgan similarity (0.25-0.29), so transferability is limited.",
    "No human absolute bioavailability data for the exact query molecule were present in the evidence set."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
